# 012-lighthouse-ttfb — Lighthouse のサーバ応答時間は 103 で何を返すか
base=http://localhost:8086 think_ms=200 cache_control=no-store samples=3

## 103 を送らない（対照）
   http://localhost:8086/012/eh?hints=none&ms=200&cc=no-store
   #1 server-response-time=205ms first-contentful-paint=1058ms largest-contentful-paint=1208ms
   #2 server-response-time=204ms first-contentful-paint=1067ms largest-contentful-paint=1217ms
   #3 server-response-time=208ms first-contentful-paint=1061ms largest-contentful-paint=1211ms

## 103 で実際に使う資源を先読みさせる
   http://localhost:8086/012/eh?hints=preload&ms=200&cc=no-store
   #1 server-response-time=1ms first-contentful-paint=1073ms largest-contentful-paint=1223ms
   #2 server-response-time=1ms first-contentful-paint=1061ms largest-contentful-paint=1211ms
   #3 server-response-time=1ms first-contentful-paint=1070ms largest-contentful-paint=1220ms

server-response-time: 205ms（103 なし）→ 1ms（103 あり）
server-response-time は 103 で落ちるか: YES
largest-contentful-paint: 1211ms → 1220ms
画面の指標も動いたか: no
103 でレポートが壊れるか: no
